Here is the code from the [URL_MASKED]:
function insertAd($path, $adlink, $expirationdate, $statusid)
{
    $conn = openDBConnection();
    $sql = "INSERT INTO `ad`( `name`, `path`, `link`, `expirationdate`, `statusid`) VALUES ('$path', '$adlink', '$expirationdate', '$statusid')";
    $conn->query($sql);
    dbConnectionClose($conn);
}

function insertAdCat($adid, $value)
{
    $conn = openDBConnection();
    $sql = "INSERT INTO adidcatid (`adid`, `catid`) VALUES ('$adid', '$value')";
    $conn->query($sql);
    dbConnectionClose($conn);
}

function insertAdvAd($advid, $adid)
{
    $conn = openDBConnection();
    $sql = "INSERT INTO advhasad (`adv_id`, `ad_id`) VALUES ('$advid', '$adid')";
    $conn->query($sql);
    dbConnectionClose($conn);
}

I select the variables $advid and $adid previous in the [URL_MASKED] file. So there shouldn't be any unknown variables...
Can someone please help me with my problem? That would be nice :)
